  "description": "YUXPUE crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C92 H102 N6 O34 Sm4,6(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.460-3.785 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 85.99-103.30°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Sm4(HL)2(H3L)2(H2L')2(PhCOO)2]·6CH3OH.",
